Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Мүмкін солай шығар?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.49,0:08:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.62,0:09:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,〜
