Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.29,0:09:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.67,0:09:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,〜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Бейбіт мектеп өмірі
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,…
